  "notes": "A supershow built around a steel cage match for the Emerald City Championship (Perfection challenging champion Vizier ta Seti); the fed's own broadcast runs out of time before the match itself and announces it will air on the following week's Chain Reaction 9 instead (not read). The fed's own title history document records the outcome directly: Perfection won the title by pinfall in that cage match, dated to this show. Several further undercard matches aired on this card (including a \"Drunken Brawl\" involving Kerry Kuroyama and Erik Mateo, and an in-fiction injury angle involving Scott Douglas's valet Courtney Allen) and are not structured; their participants are not minted beyond those already required for the fed's other served documents."
 },
