  "notes": "A milestone tenth Chain Reaction. This pass reads the show's own advertised card lineup and its closing segment, in which Perfection holds the master tapes of the Surge! cage-match footage hostage against the promotion's front office before airing the footage himself; that footage restages the earlier Emerald City Championship change (see \"IWF Presents: Surge!\") rather than depicting a fresh match, per the anti-double-count convention, so no new matches[] row is recorded here for it. The card's own advertised fresh matches (Derrick Allen vs. Johnny Niles, Jake Evans vs. Leyenda de Ocho, a Kerry Kuroyama vs. Cecilworth Farthington match, and a main event between Mary-Lynn Mayweather and The Minstrel) are not read or structured."
